    "description": "An exciting career opportunity awaits you at IRCTC Logistics Ventures Solutions. We are on the lookout for a dedicated Distribution Manager to strengthen our Lucknow-based team.\n\nAbout IRCTC Logistics Ventures Solutions:\nIRCTC Logistics Ventures Solutions is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Manage relationships with third-party logistics providers\n• Oversee end-to-end logistics operations for timely delivery\n• Manage a fleet of vehicles and coordinate with drivers\n• Coordinate with warehousing teams for inbound and outbound operations\n• Optimize delivery routes to reduce cost and improve efficiency\n• Ensure proper handling, packaging, and labeling of goods\n• Track shipments in real-time and resolve delivery exceptions\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Diploma or Degree in Hospitality Management\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Data Analytics\n• Proficiency in ERP Systems\n• Proficiency in Fleet Management\n• Proficiency in MS Excel\n• Proficiency in Route Optimization\n• Proficiency in KPI Monitoring\n• Proficiency in Inventory Management\n• Proficiency in GPS Tracking Systems\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Referral bonus program\n• Flexible working hours\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with IRCTC Logistics Ventures Solutions!",
